{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-bank-api-delexes",
    "name": "Delexes SIP — Bank Integration API",
    "description": "APIs for banks to:\n1) Create admission-form voucher applicants (Bank Dashboard flow)\n2) Look up student fee invoices and mark them paid after counter/core-banking payment\n\n**Setup**\n1. Set `base_url` (e.g. https://sip.delexesuniversity.edu.gh or http://localhost:8000)\n2. Set `bank_email` and `bank_password` for a bank-role account\n3. Run **1. Login** first — the token is saved automatically\n4. For fee payments: set `invoice_number`, `student_id`, `amount`, `bank_transaction_id`\n\n**Docs:** See BANK_API_DOCUMENTATION.md in the project.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "https://sip.delexesuniversity.edu.gh/",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "bank_email",
      "value": "bank@example.com",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "bank_password",
      "value": "your-password",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "user_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "form_type_id",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "invoice_number",
      "value": "ACC-SINV-2026-00041",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "student_id",
      "value": "DUC/2024/00123",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "amount",
      "value": "2500.00",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "bank_transaction_id",
      "value": "GCB-20260929-984512",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (json.data && json.data.token) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.data.token);",
                  "        console.log('Token saved to collection variable {{token}}');",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{bank_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{bank_password}}\",\n  \"device_name\": \"postman-bank-api\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/bank/login",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "bank", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Authenticate with a bank-role account and receive a Sanctum Bearer token.\n\nOn success, the test script stores `data.token` in the collection variable `token` for subsequent requests."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/bank/logout",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "bank", "logout"]
            },
            "description": "Revoke the current API token."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "3. Bank Profile (Me)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/bank/me",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "bank", "me"]
            },
            "description": "Returns the authenticated bank account details."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Lookups",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "4. List Form Types",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (json.data && json.data.length > 0) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('form_type_id', String(json.data[0].id));",
                  "        console.log('form_type_id set to', json.data[0].id);",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/bank/form-types",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "bank", "form-types"]
            },
            "description": "Active form types and prices. Use `id` as `form_type_id` when creating a user.\n\nPricing:\n- Nationality Ghana → local_price (GHS)\n- Other → international_price × conversion_rate"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "5. List Countries",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/bank/countries",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "bank", "countries"]
            },
            "description": "Nationality options (use exact country name, e.g. Ghana)."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Applicants (Users)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "6. Create User (Applicant + Voucher)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (json.data && json.data.user_id) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('user_id', String(json.data.user_id));",
                  "        console.log('user_id set to', json.data.user_id);",
                  "        console.log('serial_number:', json.data.serial_number);",
                  "        console.log('pin:', json.data.pin);",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Ama Mensah\",\n  \"email\": \"ama.mensah@example.com\",\n  \"phone\": \"+233551234567\",\n  \"nationality\": \"Ghana\",\n  \"form_type_id\": {{form_type_id}},\n  \"voucher_for\": \"Ama Mensah\",\n  \"send_sms\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/bank/users",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "bank", "users"]
            },
            "description": "Main integration endpoint.\n\nCreates an applicant, generates serial number + PIN, stores receipt/payment data, and optionally sends SMS.\n\n| Field | Required | Notes |\n|-------|----------|-------|\n| name | Yes | Full name |\n| email | No | Unique if provided; auto-generated if omitted |\n| phone | Yes | Used for SMS |\n| nationality | Yes | Exact country name (e.g. Ghana) |\n| form_type_id | Yes | From List Form Types |\n| voucher_for | No | Name on receipt |\n| send_sms | No | Default true |\n\nGive the applicant `serial_number` + `pin` so they can log in to the student portal.\n\nOn success, `user_id` is saved for Get User / Get Receipt."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "6b. Create User (without email)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Kwame Asante\",\n  \"phone\": \"+233209998877\",\n  \"nationality\": \"Ghana\",\n  \"form_type_id\": {{form_type_id}},\n  \"voucher_for\": \"Kwame Asante\",\n  \"send_sms\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/bank/users",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "bank", "users"]
            },
            "description": "Same as Create User, but omits email — the API auto-generates one."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "6c. Create User (international / no SMS)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"John Doe\",\n  \"email\": \"john.doe.intl@example.com\",\n  \"phone\": \"+14155552671\",\n  \"nationality\": \"United States\",\n  \"form_type_id\": {{form_type_id}},\n  \"voucher_for\": \"John Doe\",\n  \"send_sms\": false\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/bank/users",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "bank", "users"]
            },
            "description": "International nationality uses international_price × conversion_rate. SMS skipped."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "7. List Users",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/bank/users?search=&per_page=20",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "bank", "users"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "search",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "Optional — matches name, email, phone, serial number"
                },
                {
                  "key": "per_page",
                  "value": "20",
                  "description": "Default 20, max 100"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "List applicants created by this bank (`created_by` = authenticated bank)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "8. Get User",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/bank/users/{{user_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "bank", "users", "{{user_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Get one applicant (includes PIN). Scoped to applicants created by this bank.\n\nSet `user_id` after Create User, or run Create User so the test script saves it."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "9. Get Receipt",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/bank/users/{{user_id}}/receipt",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "bank", "users", "{{user_id}}", "receipt"]
            },
            "description": "Receipt details: PIN, serial, amount, receipt_number, etc.\n\nUse JSON fields for system integration. `receipt_url` is the printable web receipt (browser bank session)."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Student Invoice Payments",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "10. Lookup Invoice",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/bank/invoices/lookup?invoice_number={{invoice_number}}&student_id={{student_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "bank", "invoices", "lookup"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "invoice_number",
                  "value": "{{invoice_number}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "student_id",
                  "value": "{{student_id}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Look up a fee invoice before collecting payment.\n\nRequires Bearer token from Login.\nOptional `student_id` must match the invoice."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "11. List Student Outstanding Invoices",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/bank/students/{{student_id}}/invoices",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "bank", "students", "{{student_id}}", "invoices"]
            },
            "description": "List pending/partial invoices for a student (balance > 0).\n\nURL-encode student_id if it contains slashes (Postman usually does this for path variables)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "12. Pay Invoice (Bank Callback)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200 || pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (json.data && json.data.payment && json.data.payment.bank_transaction_id) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('bank_transaction_id', json.data.payment.bank_transaction_id);",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"invoice_number\": \"{{invoice_number}}\",\n  \"student_id\": \"{{student_id}}\",\n  \"amount\": {{amount}},\n  \"bank_transaction_id\": \"{{bank_transaction_id}}\",\n  \"paid_at\": \"2026-09-29T14:30:00\",\n  \"teller_id\": \"T-00421\",\n  \"branch_code\": \"TEMA-01\",\n  \"narration\": \"Tuition fee payment\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/bank/invoices/pay",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "bank", "invoices", "pay"]
            },
            "description": "MAIN bank callback: after funds are collected at the bank, call this to create a completed payment and update invoice status (paid / partial).\n\nIdempotent on `bank_transaction_id` — retries return already_processed: true.\n\nChange `bank_transaction_id` for each new real payment."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "13. Payment Status by Bank Txn Id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/bank/payments/{{bank_transaction_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "bank", "payments", "{{bank_transaction_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Check whether a bank transaction was already posted to SIP."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
